  << /ActualText (Python\054 Streamlit\054 RAG\054 TF\055IDF\054 scikit\055learn\054 OpenAI API\nBuilt a retrieval\055grounded AI app that generates personalized recipes from available ingredients\054 dietary restrictions\054 time limits\054 and cuisine preferences\056\n Developed a RAG pipeline using TF\055IDF and cosine similarity\054 integrating GPT\0554o\055mini to retrieve relevant recipes and generate structured recommendations\056\nImplemented constraint validation and a Streamlit interface\054 integrating GPT\0554o vision for fridge photo ingredient extraction and AI\055generated recipe imagery\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
