1270 0 obj
  << /ActualText (React\054 Node\056js\054 Express\056js\054 MongoDB\054 Mongoose\054 REST APIs\nBuilt a full\055stack meal\055planning and recipe platform supporting recipe discovery\054 favourites\054 reviews\054 weekly meal planning\054 and role\055based administration\056\nDesigned RESTful Express APIs and Mongoose schemas across 5\053 application domains\054 including users\054 recipes\054 favourites\054 reviews\054 and meal plans\056\n Implemented JWT\055based authentication and bcrypt password hashing with protected user and administrator workflows across the frontend and backend\056\nIntegrated the Spoonacular API and developed reusable React components for recipe discovery\054 meal scheduling\054 reviews\054 notifications\054 and administrative workflows\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1271 0 R
     /Pg 1249 0 R
     /S /Span
